          "type": "rtf",
          "settings": {
            "richtext_content": "<p>At Gym King, we believe that fitness and well-being are the foundations of personal growth. That’s why we’ve launched our official gym partnership initiative dedicated to supporting gyms and fitness communities worldwide. </p><p>This growth comes through hard work, discipline, and unwavering self-belief. </p>"
