        "grid_item_irEkyJ": {
          "type": "grid-item",
          "settings": {
            "grid_order": "0",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/building-foundations--2-what.png",
            "img_style": "square",
            "image_style": "cover",
            "rtf": "<h2>Building foundations  </h2><p>The Gym King Building Foundations project is built on a simple belief: <strong>strong foundations create the strength to go further.</strong></p><p>We believe training, fitness and well-being can give you the mindset, discipline and confidence to take on whatever you set out to achieve. Whether you’re chasing a personal best, building your confidence or simply becoming stronger every day, your goals start with the foundations you build.</p><p>Building Foundations is our commitment to doing the right thing — supporting gyms, athletes and fitness communities across the UK and worldwide, giving more people the opportunity to train, grow and prove what they’re capable of.</p><p><strong>Because when you have something to prove and the mindset to prove it, anything is possible.</strong></p>",
            "txt_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_align": "left",
            "use_html": false,
            "html": "<p>Add custom HTML content here.</p>",
            "show_quote": false,
            "quote_text": "This is a sample quote.",
            "quote_author": "Author Name",
