        "grid_item_azabQp": {
          "type": "grid-item",
          "settings": {
            "grid_order": "0",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/building-foundations--4-why.png",
            "img_style": "square",
            "image_style": "cover",
            "rtf": "<h2>Why we Support</h2><p>We know that becoming stronger is about more than what happens in the gym.</p><p>From day one, supporting people on their journey of personal development has been at the heart of Gym King. Training builds more than muscle — it builds discipline, resilience, confidence and the mindset to keep moving forward when things get tough.</p><p>We believe everyone deserves a place where they can train, challenge themselves and feel part of something bigger. That’s why community, motivation and the right environment matter. They create the foundations people need to push their limits, chase their goals and become the strongest version of themselves.</p><p><strong>We support the spaces that build people — because when the foundations are strong, anything is possible.</strong></p>",
            "txt_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_align": "left",
            "use_html": false,
            "html": "<p>Add custom HTML content here.</p>",
